  "_help": "One battle. at is a place on the map as fractions of its width and height: [0, 0] is the north-west corner, [1, 1] the south-east. Teams with default true (the default) are the historical force; the rest can be chosen instead before the battle. budget is the points a side may spend; leave it out to use the cost of the historical force. men gives the soldiers' names; fewer names than the team has places makes a smaller team.",
  "id": "pothus_west",
